# Otto Wilde G32 — Cursor project rule

When starting or continuing work in this repo:

1. If `local_dev/docs/HANDOFF.md` exists, read it first (next decisions, PR status, prior choices).
2. Also see `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.
3. Never stage, commit, or push anything under `local_dev/` (gitignored captures and maintainer notes).
4. Published user docs are only `README.md` and `docs/ENTITIES.md`.
5. Treat the integration as Otto Wilde **cloud** (`cloud_push`), not local LAN control.
